## 5. Kafka Topics

Two topics are used:

| Topic | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `order-created-topic` | Order Service to Inventory Service |
| `inventory-updated-topic` | Inventory Service to Order Service |

Describe a topic:

```powershell
docker exec broker kafka-topics --bootstrap-server broker:29092 --describe --topic order-created-topic
```

Check topic offsets:

```powershell
docker exec broker kafka-get-offsets --bootstrap-server broker:29092 --topic order-created-topic
```

## 6. Avro Schema and Java Class Generation

Avro defines the structure of an event.

Example `OrderCreatedEvent.avsc`:

```json
{
  "type": "record",
  "name": "OrderCreatedEvent",
  "namespace": "com.homework.learnkafka",
  "fields": [
    {"name": "orderId", "type": "string"},
    {"name": "orderStatus", "type": "string"},
    {"name": "orderTotal", "type": "double"},
    {"name": "quantity", "type": "int"}
  ]
}
```

Generate Java classes:

```powershell
mvn clean generate-sources
```

Responsibilities:

- Avro Maven plugin generates Java classes.
- Schema Registry stores and manages schemas.
- Kafka transports serialized events.

