## 16. Conclusion

This project demonstrates asynchronous communication between Spring Boot microservices using Kafka and Avro.

Order Service publishes an order event. Inventory Service consumes it, processes the stock update, and publishes a separate response event. Order Service consumes the response and updates the order status.

The project provides a foundation for understanding Kafka, Avro serialization, Schema Registry, Docker networking, and event-driven microservice architecture.
